1633	+  /// rather than by scanning [ChatState.messages] for a persisted
1634	+  /// `streaming` status, since a message loaded from history/cache can
1635	+  /// legitimately carry that same status (e.g. one left over from an
1636	+  /// earlier dropped response, the I/O matrix's own scenario) without a
1637	+  /// send actually being in progress; scanning for it would permanently
1638	+  /// disable the composer in that case.
